================================================================================
  PART 9 — TROUBLESHOOTING QUICK REFERENCE
================================================================================

Symptom: Colors swapped (red <-> blue)
Fix:     ST7789_Init.h line 19 should be 0x68 (BGR bit 0x08 set)

Symptom: Colors negative (red -> cyan, white -> black)
Fix:     Ensure line 102 (INVON) is commented out
         Ensure User_Setup.h has no #define TFT_INVERSION_ON

Symptom: Touch mirrored
Fix:     Adjust MIRROR_X / MIRROR_Y in pollTouch()
         Try all four combinations:
             (0,0) (1,0) (0,1) (1,1)

Symptom: Touch inaccurate near edges
Fix:     Re-run Touch_calibrate
         Or add INSET = 6 in pollTouch():
             if (x < INSET) x = INSET;
             if (y < INSET) y = INSET;

Symptom: Edits to library don't take effect
Fix:     Verify you edited lib/TFT_eSPI/... not .pio/libdeps/...
         Run: rm -rf .pio && pio run -t upload
         Watch for "lib54e/TFT_eSPI" in the build log

Symptom: pio: command not found or resultcallback error
Fix:     Use VS Code PlatformIO sidebar instead
         Or: python3 -m platformio run -t upload


